       "PRINCIPLE_CONCRETENESS_FADING"
      ],
      "rationale": "Negative numbers are introduced through situations a student knows: sea level, temperatures, money and yards in a game. Each phrase has one direction word, so the student links below, loss or withdrawal with a minus sign. This comes first because the context gives the sign meaning.",
